Whether ms-todo is installed on the machine running the daemon

Usage: mxr todo microsoft status [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --account <ACCOUNT>  Limit to one account; the default covers every account
      --format <FORMAT>    [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help               Print help
